            "review_title": "Review at Gazpacho Salad Bar",
            "review_text": "ashleyvan4\nGauteng, South Africa17 contributions\n0\nGreat Salads\nDec 2019\nThis is a spot with some good fresh salads. They also do a healthy salad challenge for 5 salads per week. The salads range from a chef's salad of the week vegan and meat options depending on your taste. Its located in a cool yoga studio too so if you want to get a few things done this is the place.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 9, 2019",
